OL,3,GNEWSAGritters out for the first time
OL,4,Athis autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FGritters have been out spreading on
OL,7,Froads for the first time this autumn as
OL,8,Ftemperatures dropped below 3B0C
OL,9,F(37.4B0F) in some parts of the West
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,12,FSomerset Council has warned drivers to
OL,13,Fbe cautious even though the roads have
OL,14,Fbeen gritted. The council says it focus
OL,15,Fon gritting main routes and roads used
OL,16,Fby the emergency services.
OL,18,FLast winter, the county's crews carried
OL,19,Fout more than 1,300 gritting runs
OL,20,Facross 60 days, travelling 131,172
OL,21,Fmiles (211,101km) across Somerset.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
