OL,3,GNEWSAGritters out for the first time
OL,4,Athis autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutreach teams are also working to help
OL,7,Fget rough sleepers off the streets
OL,8,Fduring the cold snap as the council has
OL,9,Factivated its Severe Weather Protocol
OL,10,F(SWEP).
